    abschluss: "Medication and drug dependence is a serious medical illness that can affect anyone, regardless of subtype, and no pattern is a verdict or a moral judgment. What emerges is simply that each of the 27 subtypes can reach for a substance as a regulating agent for its own inner reason – some through pent-up tension, others through hidden exhaustion, numbed longing, or held-back anger. This is exactly where this compass's Enneagram homeopathy begins: not at the outward symptom, but at the life force of the respective subtype that has fallen out of balance – always as a complement to medically supervised addiction treatment, never as a substitute for it. When this life force is brought back into balance, the path out of dependency can become easier to walk, even though it requires patience, professional support, and often several attempts."
